  "marketBrief": {
    "text": [
      "Since she won Head of Household in Week 4, Haley Thogmartin had the power to nominate Drew Campbell, Melody Morris, and Taylor Brown for eviction.",
      "Drew had been playing both sides of the house, and nominating him was a strategic gamble by Haley's alliance since it offers him two chances to save himself.",
      "It was Taylor Brown, however, that won Power of Veto, and so she made it off the chopping block, leaving just Drew, Melody, and Lyric (as her replacement).",
      "Kalshi had Drew as the clear favorite to go into Thursday, at more than 60%, but Melody overtook him as the late favorite after Dee and Rick ran a campaign to flip the vote.",
      "The plot was in for another twist on eviction night itself, when Lyric Medeiros was voted out."
    ],
